<details><summary>Permissions and service availability</summary><ul class="ms-permissions"><?php foreach(ms_scopes()as$scope):?><li><?=e($scope)?></li><?php endforeach;?></ul><p>Microsoft will ask for these delegated read permissions and ongoing access. A permission grant is separate from a successful service check. Account policies, provisioning and licences can restrict individual features. Gmail email is connected through Google; a Gmail address used as a Microsoft login does not itself provide access to Gmail mail.</p></details>
<details><summary>Further Microsoft 365 capabilities</summary><p>Word, Excel and PowerPoint files can be discovered through OneDrive; document editing stays in Microsoft. Mail sending and drafts, calendar changes, Teams chats and meeting creation, SharePoint, Planner, Forms, Power Automate and Copilot need additional implementation and permissions. This connection does not enable those features. Microsoft Graph meeting creation does not support personal Microsoft accounts.</p></details></section>
